::kind(fixture)
::meta(
  tags: (a, b, sep: ",")
  size: (w: 10, h: 20)
  x: ((a, version: 3), b, c)
  icon: glyph(triangle, pkg: lucide)
  use: vocab(a, version: 3)
  ordered: ("1": a, b)
  status: ("404": x, "500": y)
  numbered: ("0": a, "1": b)
)

=[ Tuple ]

A tuple at a value position takes named and unnamed entries together.

@item(tags: (a, b, sep: ","), size: (w: 10, h: 20))

@item(x: ((a, version: 3), b, c))

A call takes named and unnamed entries together.

@item(icon: glyph(triangle, pkg: lucide), use: vocab(a, version: 3))

Entries may be keyed by decimal text.

@item(ordered: ("1": a, b), status: ("404": x, "500": y), numbered: ("0": a, "1": b))
